<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Hyderabad to Cochin | Safe Auto Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a car transport from Hyderabad to Cochin usually take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The typical transit time for a vehicle moving from Hyderabad to Cochin is 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic conditions on NH44 and any unforeseen roadwork. Our dedicated hydraulic ramp trailers operate on express freight corridors, ensuring a swift and predictable delivery schedule.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What measures are taken to protect my vehicle from scratches during the Hyderabad to Cochin journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a zero‑scratch guarantee that includes 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and custom wooden crates for delicate parts. Hydraulic ramp trailers with soft‑rubber rollers eliminate contact damage, while real‑time GPS monitoring ensures the vehicle is handled only by trained personnel.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the Hyderabad to Cochin car transport service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance at no extra cost. This policy protects against loss, theft, or accidental damage, giving you complete peace of mind throughout the Hyderabad to Cochin relocation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car in real time while it travels from Hyderabad to Cochin?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our specialized container trucks are equipped with satellite‑enabled GPS devices that feed live location updates to our client portal. You can view the exact position of your vehicle on the Hyderabad‑Cochin route, receive status alerts, and contact the driver directly if needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to move my car from Hyderabad to Cochin?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The essential paperwork includes a valid vehicle registration certificate, insurance copy, a signed consignment note, a PAN‑linked invoice for GST compliance, and a government‑issued identity proof (Aadhaar or passport). For corporate clients, a No‑Objection Certificate (NOC) from the employer may also be needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for Hyderabad to Cochin car transport calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on four core components: distance‑based mileage charge, vehicle size and weight, fuel surcharge reflecting current diesel rates, and optional add‑ons such as premium insurance or expedited delivery. Our transparent cost breakdown ensures no hidden fees, and the final quote is provided before any booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on the type or size of vehicles that can be shipped from Hyderabad to Cochin?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our fleet accommodates cars, SUVs, and light commercial vehicles up to 2.5 tons. Oversized or high‑clearance vehicles may require a custom quote and specialized trailer. We do not transport two‑wheelers on the same carrier; they are moved using dedicated two‑wheeler carriers with wheel chocks for extra safety.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
